        <p class="kd-eyebrow">04 · AI · Vibe Code</p>
        <h1 class="kd-detail-title">Building with AI</h1>
        <p class="kd-detail-sub">Directing AI coding agents is a core skill of this era. I work with Claude Code and Codex: I own the intent, the constraints, the taste and the verification; the agents write the implementation; I judge the result by eye and in game.</p>
    </div>
